# Repos for sync-git-local-repos and git-commits-per-month.
# Copy to repos.conf and edit.
#
# Format (tab-separated):  Project name	repo-dir-name	URL
# Repos are cloned into ~/workspace/<repo-dir-name>
#
# Example 3-column:
# My App - iOS	my-app	https://github.com/org/my-app.git
# My App - Backend	my-app-backend	https://github.com/org/my-app-backend.git
#
# Simple format (one URL per line) also works; dir name is derived from URL:
# https://github.com/org/repo-name.git
